  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s9IcuV5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available for Minecraft-1.19 | 1.18 | 1.17 | 1.16-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"386\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install on-Client Only-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"210\" height=\"28\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-mods-button/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 关于:</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Better Mods Button</strong> 将模组按钮重新添加到暂停界面，就像 Minecraft 1.13 之前的 Forge 版本一样，因此可以轻松访问游戏内的模组配置（如果可用）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">作为额外功能，您可以选择模组按钮在屏幕上的显示位置和方式（灵感来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a>）。支持显示模组总数以及切换更新通知标志。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 媒体:</strong></span></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/897/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/898/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>主界面默认模组按钮</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>模组按钮的替代位置之一</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/899/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/900/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>暂停菜单默认模组按钮</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>暂停界面的替代位置</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/901/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>暂停界面的另一个替代按钮位置</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常见问题:</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：如何配置这个模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong> 安装我的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模组，直接在游戏内配置！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：Fabric 版本呢？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong> 使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a>，由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/prospectordev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ProspectorDev</strong></span></a> 开发。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 致谢:</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">开发 Better Mods Button 得到了以下帮助和启发：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/prospectordev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ProspectorDev</strong></span></a> 的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a> 模组，启发了本模组的大部分配置选项</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzss&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=u/Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs 0212&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DCwxKZU.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/console-experience\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aXWOS7B.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DTzDrbm.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sHiR309.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
